# SPA fallback for hosts that read a `_redirects` file (Cloudflare Pages,
# Netlify, and others). Every unknown path serves the app shell; React Router
# resolves the route client-side.
#
#   200  = rewrite (URL is preserved). A 301/302 here would break deep links.
#
# Existing static files are served before this rule is consulted, so
# /assets/*, /favicon.svg, /robots.txt and /sitemap.xml are unaffected.
/*    /index.html   200
